{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Par Party</strong>\u00a0is a no holds parred platforming party golf game where you and your friends build courses with traps, powerups, and more!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level editor!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your imagination go wild and draw the golf course of your dreams in Par Party's unique level editor! Share it with your friends, your enemies, or the whole world on the <strong>Steam Workshop</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Up to 8 Player online multiplayer!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At last you can prove you are the best, par none.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Powerups!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strap on a jetpack, turn your friends into cubes, become a football, and so much more!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Special Game Modes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try your hand at drawing a level within the time limit and challenge your friends to beat it. Or just play the community levels with custom game settings!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customization!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make yourself un-fore-gettable with an in-depth customization system</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Final note:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I promise there aren't this many puns in the actual game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2763850?t=1760121670","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2763850?t=1760121670","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763850/52138e44e47dde0c6a09b035610e765d763427ef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760121670","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763850/52138e44e47dde0c6a09b035610e765d763427ef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760121670","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Par Party</strong>\u00a0is a no holds parred platforming party golf game where you and your friends build courses with traps, powerups, and more!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level editor!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your imagination go wild and draw the golf course of your dreams in Par Party's unique level editor! Share it with your friends, your enemies, or the whole world on the <strong>Steam Workshop</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Up to 8 Player online multiplayer!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At last you can prove you are the best, par none.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Powerups!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strap on a jetpack, turn your friends into cubes, become a football, and so much more!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Special Game Modes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try your hand at drawing a level within the time limit and challenge your friends to beat it. Or just play the community levels with custom game settings!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customization!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make yourself un-fore-gettable with an in-depth customization system</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Final note:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I promise there aren't this many puns in the actual game.</p>","developers":["Chronic Vagrant"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763850/1c4f7bd4587606719d7f6a5e1e465eff0fc6b5d0/header.jpg?t=1760121670","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul clas